 to feel close to the metal.\n*   You will be able to find a lot of resources for the topics listed in this roadmap using C or C++. You can find a lot of resources for Python and Java, but they are not as abundant as C++ and C.\n\nGiven below is the list of resources; pick ones relevant to the language of your choice.","title":"Conditional Rendering","resources":[{"type":"roadmap","title":"Visit Dedicated C++ Roadmap","url":"https://roadmap.sh/cpp","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3c36"},{"type":"article","title":"Learn C++ - Tutorials Point","url":"https://www.tutorialspoint.com/cplusplus/index.htm","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3c37"},{"type":"article","title":"Learn C - Tutorials Point","url":"https://www.tutorialspoint.com/cprogramming/index.htm","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3c38"},{"type":"video","title":"C++ Programming Course - Beginner to Advanced","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8jLOx1hD3_o","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3c39"},{"type":"video","title":"C++ Tutorial for Beginners - Full Course","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vLnPwxZdW4Y","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3c3a"},{"type":"video","title":"C Programming Tutorial for Beginners","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KJgsSFOSQv0","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3c3b"},{"type":"video","title":"Learn C Programming with Dr. Chuck","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j-_s8f5K30I","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3c3c"}],"prerequisites":[],"description":"# Pick a Language\n\nYou need to pick a programming language to learn the Computer Science concepts. My personal recommendation would be to pick C++ or C and the reason for that is:\n\n*   They allow you to deal with pointers and memory allocation/deallocation, so you feel the data structures and algori...","order":60,"leadsTo":[]},{"nodeId":"y9ToYDix-koRbR6FLydFw","fullDescription":"# Vite\n\nVite is a build tool that aims to provide a faster and leaner development experience for modern web projects.","title":"create-vue","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Vi